---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PartnerBadges from '../components/PartnerBadges.astro';
import PlatformComparison from '../components/PlatformComparison.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "The Visible Ads Blueprint | Our Methodology",
      "description": "Our proven 4-phase growth methodology: Discover, Strategise, Execute, Optimise.",
      "url": "https://visible-ads.com/blueprint",
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Visible Ads"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://visible-ads.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Blueprint", "item": "https://visible-ads.com/blueprint" }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout title="The Visible Ads Blueprint | Our Methodology" description="Our proven 4-phase growth methodology: Discover, Strategise, Execute, Optimise. Continuous improvement for sustainable advertising growth." schema={schema}>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-light relative overflow-hidden" data-animate>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 dot-pattern opacity-5"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-electric/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-electric-light" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6 3.75h2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 10.5 6v2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H6a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6ZM3.75 15.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 6 13.5h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V18a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3.75 18v-2.25ZM13.5 6a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25H18A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 20.25 6v2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 10.5h-2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25-2.25V6ZM13.5 15.75a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25H18a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25V18A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 18 20.25h-2.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 13.5 18v-2.25Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">The Visible Ads Blueprint</h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-light leading-relaxed">Every successful advertising campaign starts with a system. Our Blueprint is the proven methodology we apply to every engagement, ensuring nothing is left to chance and every pound of your budget works harder than the last.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

      <div class="hidden lg:block relative mb-16">
        <div class="absolute top-8 left-[12.5%] right-[12.5%] h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric via-cyan-400 to-electric rounded-full"></div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative">
          {[
            { n: 1, bg: 'bg-electric', shadow: 'shadow-electric/30' },
            { n: 2, bg: 'bg-amber-500', shadow: 'shadow-amber-500/30' },
            { n: 3, bg: 'bg-purple-600', shadow: 'shadow-purple-600/30' },
            { n: 4, bg: 'bg-emerald-500', shadow: 'shadow-emerald-500/30' },
          ].map(({ n, bg, shadow }) => (
            <div class="flex justify-center">
              <div class={`w-16 h-16 rounded-full ${bg} text-white font-heading font-bold text-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg ${shadow} ring-4 ring-white`}>{n}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-20 lg:space-y-0 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8">

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-electric text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-electric/30 flex-shrink-0">1</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-electric/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-electric" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Discover</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Before we touch a single campaign setting, we need to understand the full picture. Our discovery phase is an exhaustive deep-dive into your current advertising performance, identifying what is working, what is bleeding budget, and where the untapped opportunities sit. This is exactly what our <a href="/free-ads-audit" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">free ads audit</a> delivers.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">We analyse your competitive landscape to understand how rivals are bidding, what messaging they lead with, and where gaps exist in the market that your brand can own. This is not a surface-level glance. We pull data from every available source and cross-reference it against industry benchmarks.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">The output is a clear, honest assessment of where you stand and exactly how much room there is to grow.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-electric mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Full account audit report</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Competitor analysis</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Market opportunity sizing</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-electric flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Wasted spend identification</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/30 flex-shrink-0">2</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-amber-500/10 hover:ring-amber-500/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-amber-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Strategise</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">With a complete picture of the landscape, we build a data-driven strategy that connects your advertising directly to your business objectives. This is not a generic playbook. Every recommendation is tailored to your market, your margins, and your growth targets.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">We determine the right channel mix, whether that is <a href="/google-ads" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Google Ads</a>, <a href="/bing-ads" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Bing Ads</a>, <a href="/amazon" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">Amazon</a>, <a href="/paid-social" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">paid social</a>, or a combination. Budget allocation is modelled against projected returns so you know exactly what to expect before a single penny is spent.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">The strategy document becomes your north star for the engagement, something we revisit and refine as performance data comes in.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-500 mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Channel strategy document</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Budget allocation model</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>KPI targets and forecasts</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Keyword and audience research</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-purple-600 text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30 flex-shrink-0">3</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-purple-600/10 hover:ring-purple-600/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-purple-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Execute</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">This is where the strategy comes to life. Our team builds out every campaign element with precision: account structure, ad groups, keyword lists, negative keywords, bidding strategies, ad copy, extensions, and audiences. Nothing is rushed and nothing is templated.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">We develop compelling creative assets and work with you on landing page optimisation to ensure the full journey from ad click to conversion is seamless. Our <a href="/ecro" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">eCRO service</a> takes this further with systematic A/B testing. If your landing pages are letting you down, we will tell you exactly what to fix and why.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">Launch is carefully staged. We monitor performance in real-time during the critical first days, making rapid adjustments to ensure the campaign hits the ground running.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600 mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Campaign build and launch</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Ad copy and creative assets</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Landing page recommendations</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-purple-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Tracking and conversion setup</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative">
          <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white font-heading font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 flex-shrink-0">4</div>
            <div class="h-0.5 flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-transparent"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/10 hover:ring-emerald-500/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all h-full">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-emerald-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Optimise</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">Launching a campaign is just the beginning. The real value is in what happens next. Our optimisation phase is a continuous cycle of testing, learning, and improving. We analyse performance data daily, adjusting bids, refining audiences, testing new ad variations, and eliminating waste.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">We run structured A/B tests on ad copy, landing pages, and bidding strategies. Winners are scaled. Underperformers are paused or reworked. Every decision is backed by data, not gut feeling. For organic channels, our <a href="/seo" class="text-electric underline hover:text-electric-dark">SEO service</a> follows the same data-driven optimisation cycle.</p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">Monthly reporting gives you full visibility into performance, spend, and the actions we have taken. You always know where your money is going and what it is generating.</p>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500 mb-3">Key Deliverables</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Monthly performance reports</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>A/B test results and insights</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Bid and budget optimisation</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>Scaling recommendations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-sky-tint" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-6">Why a Blueprint?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">Most agencies treat advertising as a set-and-forget exercise. Build the campaigns, let them run, send a report at the end of the month. That approach leaves performance on the table and wastes your budget on outdated assumptions.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">The Visible Ads Blueprint is built on a philosophy of continuous improvement. Markets shift. Competitors adapt. Consumer behaviour evolves. Your advertising must evolve with it, and that requires a systematic, disciplined approach to optimisation that never stops learning.</p>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">We have refined this methodology over 20 years and hundreds of client engagements. It works because it is repeatable, measurable, and adaptable to any industry, any platform, and any budget.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="relative h-48 sm:h-64 overflow-hidden">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Data-driven advertising planning and strategy" class="w-full h-full object-cover" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-navy/80 to-navy/40 flex items-center justify-center">
      <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-white text-center px-8">Data-Driven Decisions. Measurable Results.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Platform Comparison -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-gray-50" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Platform Strengths at a Glance</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every platform has its sweet spot. We help you invest where it matters most.</p>
      </div>
      <PlatformComparison />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services We Deploy -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-4">Services We Deploy</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto">The Blueprint powers every channel we manage. Here is how it comes to life across your marketing stack.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/google-ads" class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-electric/10 hover:ring-electric/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-electric transition-colors">Google Ads Management</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm mb-3">Our core PPC service. Search, Shopping, Display, and Performance Max campaigns built on the Blueprint methodology.</p>
          <span class="text-electric text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">Learn more <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
        </a>
        <a href="/paid-social" class="group relative bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-md border border-gray-100 ring-1 ring-pink-500/10 hover:ring-pink-500/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-navy mb-2 group-hover:text-pink-600 transition-colors">Paid Social Advertising</h3>
